{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 4,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 376.257,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now it came to pass in the sixth year of the reign of the judges over the people of Nephi,",
      "verse": "4:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 6.264,
      "end": 10.258,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there were no contentions nor wars in the land of Zarahemla;",
      "verse": "4:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 10.938,
      "end": 12.796,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But the people were afflicted,",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 12.976,
      "end": 22.961,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, greatly afflicted for the loss of their brethren, and also for the loss of their flocks and herds, and also for the loss of their fields of grain,",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 23.141,
      "end": 26.81,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were trodden under foot and destroyed by the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 27.49,
      "end": 32.831,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And so great were their afflictions that every soul had cause to mourn;",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 33.011,
      "end": 40.674,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they believed that it was the judgments of God sent upon them because of their wickedness and their abominations;",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 40.854,
      "end": 44.43,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they were awakened to a remembrance of their duty.",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 45.11,
      "end": 48.221,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they began to establish the church more fully;",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 48.401,
      "end": 51.93,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and many were baptized in the waters of Sidon",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 52.11,
      "end": 54.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and were joined to the church of God;",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 54.473,
      "end": 57.167,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they were baptized by the hand of Alma,",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 57.347,
      "end": 63.663,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had been consecrated the high priest over the people of the church, by the hand of his father Alma.",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 64.343,
      "end": 68.383,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass in the seventh year of the reign of the judges",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 68.563,
      "end": 72.046,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there were about three thousand five hundred souls",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 72.226,
      "end": 75.848,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that united themselves to the church of God and were baptized.",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 76.028,
      "end": 81.044,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus ended the seventh year of the reign of the judges over the people of Nephi;",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 81.224,
      "end": 83.592,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there was continual peace in all that time.",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 84.272,
      "end": 88.08,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass in the eighth year of the reign of the judges,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 88.26,
      "end": 93.74,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the people of the church began to wax proud, because of their exceeding riches,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 93.92,
      "end": 97.124,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their fine silks, and their fine-twined linen,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 97.304,
      "end": 100.09,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and because of their many flocks and herds,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 100.27,
      "end": 102.731,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their gold and their silver,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 102.911,
      "end": 107.462,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all manner of precious things, which they had obtained by their industry;",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 107.642,
      "end": 111.497,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in all these things were they lifted up in the pride of their eyes,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 111.677,
      "end": 114.556,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they began to wear very costly apparel.",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 115.236,
      "end": 118.533,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this was the cause of much affliction to Alma,",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 118.713,
      "end": 124.286,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and to many of the people whom Alma had consecrated to be teachers, and priests,",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 124.466,
      "end": 126.602,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and elders over the church;",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 126.782,
      "end": 130.358,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, many of them were sorely grieved for the wickedness",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 130.538,
      "end": 133.928,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which they saw had begun to be among their people.",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 134.608,
      "end": 142.689,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For they saw and beheld with great sorrow that the people of the church began to be lifted up in the pride of their eyes,",
      "verse": "4:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 142.869,
      "end": 145.284,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to set their hearts upon riches",
      "verse": "4:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 145.464,
      "end": 147.972,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and upon the vain things of the world,",
      "verse": "4:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 148.152,
      "end": 151.914,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they began to be scornful, one towards another,",
      "verse": "4:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 152.094,
      "end": 158.038,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they began to persecute those that did not believe according to their own will and pleasure.",
      "verse": "4:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 158.718,
      "end": 162.201,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus, in this eighth year of the reign of the judges,",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 162.381,
      "end": 167.071,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there began to be great contentions among the people of the church;",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 167.251,
      "end": 169.898,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, there were envyings, and strife,",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 170.078,
      "end": 172.772,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and malice, and persecutions, and pride,",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 172.952,
      "end": 177.178,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even to exceed the pride of those who did not belong to the church of God.",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 177.858,
      "end": 181.713,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus ended the eighth year of the reign of the judges;",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 181.893,
      "end": 189.741,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the wickedness of the church was a great stumbling-block to those who did not belong to the church;",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 189.921,
      "end": 193.45,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus the church began to fail in its progress.",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 194.13,
      "end": 197.288,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass in the commencement of the ninth year,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 197.468,
      "end": 200.069,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Alma saw the wickedness of the church,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 200.249,
      "end": 209.351,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he saw also that the example of the church began to lead those who were unbelievers on from one piece of iniquity to another,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 209.531,
      "end": 212.225,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thus bringing on the destruction of the people.",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 212.905,
      "end": 215.831,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, he saw great inequality among the people,",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 216.011,
      "end": 218.844,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "some lifting themselves up with their pride,",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 219.024,
      "end": 220.649,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "despising others,",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 220.829,
      "end": 224.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "turning their backs upon the needy and the naked",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 224.306,
      "end": 227.603,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and those who were hungry, and those who were athirst,",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 227.783,
      "end": 229.919,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and those who were sick and afflicted.",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 230.599,
      "end": 234.454,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this was a great cause for lamentations among the people,",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 234.634,
      "end": 240.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "while others were abasing themselves, succoring those who stood in need of their succor,",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 240.619,
      "end": 245.031,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "such as imparting their substance to the poor and the needy, feeding the hungry,",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 245.211,
      "end": 248.926,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and suffering all manner of afflictions, for Christ's sake,",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 249.106,
      "end": 252.032,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who should come according to the spirit of prophecy;",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 252.712,
      "end": 254.337,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Looking forward to that day,",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 254.517,
      "end": 257.35,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thus retaining a remission of their sins;",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 257.53,
      "end": 267.236,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "being filled with great joy because of the resurrection of the dead, according to the will and power and deliverance of Jesus Christ from the bands of death.",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 267.916,
      "end": 273.489,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that Alma, having seen the afflictions of the humble followers of God,",
      "verse": "4:15",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 273.669,
      "end": 278.452,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the persecutions which were heaped upon them by the remainder of his people,",
      "verse": "4:15",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 278.632,
      "end": 282.812,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and seeing all their inequality, began to be very sorrowful;",
      "verse": "4:15",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 282.992,
      "end": 286.011,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless the Spirit of the Lord did not fail him.",
      "verse": "4:15",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 286.691,
      "end": 290.963,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he selected a wise man who was among the elders of the church,",
      "verse": "4:16",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 291.143,
      "end": 294.672,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and gave him power according to the voice of the people,",
      "verse": "4:16",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 294.852,
      "end": 300.053,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might have power to enact laws according to the laws which had been given,",
      "verse": "4:16",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 300.233,
      "end": 304.97,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to put them in force according to the wickedness and the crimes of the people.",
      "verse": "4:16",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 305.65,
      "end": 307.693,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this man's name was Nephihah,",
      "verse": "4:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 307.873,
      "end": 310.195,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he was appointed chief judge;",
      "verse": "4:17",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 310.375,
      "end": 314.369,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he sat in the judgment-seat to judge and to govern the people.",
      "verse": "4:17",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 315.049,
      "end": 320.065,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Alma did not grant unto him the office of being high priest over the church,",
      "verse": "4:18",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 320.245,
      "end": 323.403,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but he retained the office of high priest unto himself;",
      "verse": "4:18",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 323.583,
      "end": 326.927,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but he delivered the judgment-seat unto Nephihah.",
      "verse": "4:18",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 327.607,
      "end": 328.907,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And this he did",
      "verse": "4:19",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 329.087,
      "end": 331.92,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he himself might go forth among his people,",
      "verse": "4:19",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 332.1,
      "end": 334.097,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or among the people of Nephi,",
      "verse": "4:19",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 334.277,
      "end": 337.342,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might preach the word of God unto them,",
      "verse": "4:19",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 337.522,
      "end": 340.448,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to stir them up in remembrance of their duty,",
      "verse": "4:19",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 340.628,
      "end": 343.554,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that he might pull down by the word of God,",
      "verse": "4:19",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 343.734,
      "end": 348.61,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "all the pride and craftiness and all the contentions which were among his people,",
      "verse": "4:19",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 348.79,
      "end": 351.344,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "seeing no way that he might reclaim them",
      "verse": "4:19",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 351.524,
      "end": 354.914,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it were in bearing down in pure testimony against them.",
      "verse": "4:19",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 355.594,
      "end": 361.678,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus in the commencement of the ninth year of the reign of the judges over the people of Nephi,",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 361.858,
      "end": 365.248,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Alma delivered up the judgment-seat to Nephihah",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 365.428,
      "end": 370.583,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and confined himself wholly to the high priesthood of the holy order of God,",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 370.763,
      "end": 375.593,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to the testimony of the word, according to the spirit of revelation and prophecy.",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 92
    }
  ]
}